  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are politically engaged, particularly those who support or are sympathetic to Donald Trump's immigration policies, including his proposed border wall. The meme is designed to resonate with voters or followers who view immigration as a primary security threat and who may be inclined to support isolationist or xenophobic policies. It appeals to those who interpret the 2015 Paris terrorist attack as justification for stricter border controls, thereby framing Trump's wall as a rational, necessary response. The rhetorical question format is intended to provoke agreement from this audience by leveraging the emotional weight of the Paris attack to validate a controversial political stance.",
